---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects — George Choulakis">
  <main class="container page">
    <p class="eyebrow">projects</p>
    <h1>Things I build.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Selected patterns and projects around data, automation, reporting, and integration.</p>

    <div class="project-grid">
      <article class="card blue">
        <div class="top mono">REPORTING / AUTOMATION</div>
        <h2>From recurring manual work to a traceable process</h2>
        <p>Designing the layers, checks, and handover points that make recurring reporting easier to run and easier to trust.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span>SQL</span><span>Power BI</span><span>Automation</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="card yellow">
        <div class="top mono">INTEGRATION / DATA</div>
        <h2>Making operational data usable without hiding its history</h2>
        <p>Thinking about source systems, staging, slowly changing dimensions, validation, and clean interfaces for downstream reporting.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span>SQL Server</span><span>ETL</span><span>Data modelling</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="card white">
        <div class="top mono">INTERNAL TOOLS</div>
        <h2>Small tools that remove surprisingly large amounts of friction</h2>
        <p>Interfaces, scripts, exports, and workflows that turn repeated business tasks into something people can operate confidently.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span>Python</span><span>PowerShell</span><span>APIs</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="cta">
      <p class="eyebrow">a note on case studies</p>
      <h2>I write about patterns, not confidential data.</h2>
      <p>When work originates inside a company, I keep private systems and sensitive details private while explaining the technical ideas that are useful elsewhere.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.page { padding-top:75px; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(3.6rem,8vw,7rem); line-height:.94; letter-spacing:-.06em; margin:16px 0 24px; }
.lead { color:var(--muted); font-size:1.2rem; max-width:720px; }
.project-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:22px; margin-top:65px; }
.card { min-height:390px; border:2px solid #111; border-radius:30px; padding:30px; box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #111; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
.card:nth-child(3) { grid-column:1 / -1; min-height:300px; }
.blue { background:var(--blue-soft); }
.yellow { background:#fff3c8; }
.white { background:#fff; }
.top { font-size:.72rem; color:#66717c; }
.card h2 { font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.045em; margin:28px 0 20px; max-width:800px; }
.card p { color:#515c67; max-width:760px; }
.chips { margin-top:auto; display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.chips span { border:1.5px solid #111; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; background:#fff; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:700; }
.cta { margin:110px 0 20px; max-width:850px; }
.cta h2 { font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4rem); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.04em; margin:15px 0; }
.cta > p:last-child { color:var(--muted); }
@media(max-width:760px){ .project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .card:nth-child(3){grid-column:auto;} }
</style>
